}, {'text': "You can take something which is typically on the inside and you can put it outside, and then you can have other error minimizing systems look at it and fiddle around with it and then we can reimbibe it. We're doing this all the time. That's what language allows us to do and what writing allows us to do. Think about maths.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.9986099004745483, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ProgrammingLanguages'}, {'relevance': 0.4067051112651825, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing'}, {'relevance': 0.026120806112885475, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications'}, {'relevance': 0.02347954921424389, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>ArtificialIntelligence'}, {'relevance': 0.006140579469501972, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>Internet>WebDevelopment'}, {'relevance': 0.004457509145140648, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications>Databases'}, {'relevance': 0.004262707196176052, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications>OperatingSystems'}, {'relevance': 0.0033066077157855034, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>Internet>WebDesignAndHTML'}, {'relevance': 0.002659392077475786, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications>DesktopPublishing'}, {'relevance': 0.002332680858671665, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>ContentProduction>FreelanceWriting'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 1038066, 'end': 1055542}, 'sentences_idx_start': 143, 'sentences_idx_end': 146}, {'text': "You're bringing up part of your predictive understanding, you're laying it out and then other predictive agents can fiddle around with it and then you can take it back in as part of your updating your own model. And I don't know how much more I can say here. I just think this is a kind of horizon. But I think there's a really juicy thing to say here. About where real art is. Like Tolstoy.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.9633848667144775, 'label': 'FineArt'}, 