art': 362, 'sentences_idx_end': 363}, {'text': "So I think there's a lot of really interesting work to potentially be done there. I will take the opportunity to shamelessly plug a preprint that Mark and I have released recently, where one thing that I'm really interested in, that I can kind of speak with some confidence on is the fact that I do think there's a point at which the theory of affordances or the language of affordances, starts to break down to. So the preprint I'll share around is looking at ambient technology specifically.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.9386175274848938, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>ConsumerElectronics>WearableTechnology'}, {'relevance': 0.8023616671562195, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>Internet>InternetOfThings'}, {'relevance': 0.6291037797927856, 'label': 'Home&Garden>SmartHome'}, {'relevance': 0.048792265355587006, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>AugmentedReality'}, {'relevance': 0.02452346310019493, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>ConsumerElectronics'}, {'relevance': 0.02190479449927807, 'label': 'Technology&Computing'}, {'relevance': 0.007166153285652399, 'label': 'BusinessAndFinance>Industries>TechnologyIndustry'}, {'relevance': 0.0062558711506426334, 'label': 'Home&Garden>HomeAppliances'}, {'relevance': 0.005656364373862743, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>VirtualReality'}, {'relevance': 0.004833506885915995, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>Internet>ITAndInternetSupport'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 2475518, 'end': 2515002}, 'sentences_idx_start': 364, 'sentences_idx_end': 366}, {'text': "So this is technology that the whole kind of impetus behind its design and conceptualization is that the user doesn't have to actually do anything. So it precedes the user Pragmatically and epistemically. It knows what kinds of things you want it to do, and it just does them in the background. And it works by shifting kind of it subtly shifts the material environment such that it impacts your field of affordances in real time.", 'l