bel': 'NewsAndPolitics>Politics>PoliticalIssues'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 5460740, 'end': 5506770}, 'sentences_idx_start': 742, 'sentences_idx_end': 744}, {'text': "They'll do what I can do in the solo lecture, and I'll look forward to the conversation where we can unpack. It exciting. Thank you for doing it. I'm looking forward to it. Yeah, it's awesome. Nathan or David, you want to add anything? All right, then. Thank you all. Hope everyone is enjoying the course so far. Thanks, Avel, again for coordinating it. And to Ben for this great section.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.8639715909957886, 'label': 'Education>OnlineEducation'}, {'relevance': 0.030031923204660416, 'label': 'Education>EducationalAssessment'}, {'relevance': 0.017198923975229263, 'label': 'Education>AdultEducation'}, {'relevance': 0.00913053285330534, 'label': 'Education>CollegeEducation>PostgraduateEducation>ProfessionalSchool'}, {'relevance': 0.006923200096935034, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications>WebConferencing'}, {'relevance': 0.004480031784623861, 'label': 'Education>HomeworkAndStudy'}, {'relevance': 0.0030500120483338833, 'label': 'Education>LanguageLearning'}, {'relevance': 0.0021782563999295235, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>ContentProduction'}, {'relevance': 0.0021549330558627844, 'label': 'BusinessAndFinance>Industries>EducationIndustry'}, {'relevance': 0.0021120100282132626, 'label': 'BusinessAndFinance>Business>ExecutiveLeadership&Management'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 5509700, 'end': 5542482}, 'sentences_idx_start': 745, 'sentences_idx_end': 755}, {'text': 'Now you can put on your student hat again. And to you for organizing. Thank you. See you all next time. Thanks. Bye. Thank you. Thanks, everyone.', 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.15088048577308655, 'label': 'EventsAndAttractions>PersonalCelebrations&LifeEvents>Graduation'}, {'relevance': 0.00785316526889801, 'label': 'EventsAndAttractions>PersonalCelebrations&LifeEvents>Prom'}, {'relevance': 0.007721