': 118600, 'confidence': 0.94066, 'speaker': 'A'}]}, {'text': "Hi, everyone. Can you hear me? Yep. I'm Francisco Balsan. I'm a PhD student at the University of Bologna, Italy, actually working on intersection between artificial intelligence and education.", 'start': 124170, 'end': 137040, 'confidence': 0.99281, 'words': [{'text': 'Hi,', 'start': 124170, 'end': 124534, 'confidence': 0.99281, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'everyone.', 'start': 124572, 'end': 124822, 'confidence': 0.99995, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'Can', 'start': 124876, 'end': 124998, 'confidence': 0.99997, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'you', 'start': 125004, 'end': 125126, 'confidence': 0.99569, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'hear', 'start': 125148, 'end': 125286, 'confidence': 0.99994, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'me?', 'start': 125308, 'end': 125880, 'confidence': 0.98733, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'Yep.', 'start': 126410, 'end': 127298, 'confidence': 0.7531, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': "I'm", 'start': 127474, 'end': 127906, 'confidence': 0.99853, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'Francisco', 'start': 127938, 'end': 128386, 'confidence': 0.33587, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'Balsan.', 'start': 128418, 'end': 129022, 'confidence': 0.14527, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': "I'm", 'start': 129106, 'end': 129318, 'confidence': 0.99925, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'a', 'start': 129334, 'end': 129466, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'PhD', 'start': 129488, 'end': 129894, 'confidence': 0.99776, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'student', 'start': 129942, 'end': 130202, 'confidence': 0.99888, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'at', 'start': 130256, 'end': 130426, 'confidence': 0.56, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'the', 'start': 130448, 'end': 130586, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'University', 'start': 130608, 'end': 130966, 'confidence': 0.9998, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'of', 'start': 130998, 'end': 131098, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'E'}, {'text': 'Bologna,', 'start': 131104, 'end': 131494, 'confidence': 0.5232, 'speaker':