rocessing perspective, the idea that magic is just these wonderful kind of violations of expectations. In a certain sense, I think predictive processing provides a nice, really intuitive framework for thinking about those kinds of things. One little point there, Regina.", 'start': 1290730, 'end': 1323502, 'confidence': 0.4189, 'words': [{'text': 'Spoke', 'start': 1290730, 'end': 1291282, 'confidence': 0.4189, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'to', 'start': 1291346, 'end': 1291960, 'confidence': 0.99, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'I', 'start': 1293050, 'end': 1293414, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'forget', 'start': 1293452, 'end': 1293794, 'confidence': 0.99978, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'the', 'start': 1293842, 'end': 1293958, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': "person's", 'start': 1293964, 'end': 1294354, 'confidence': 0.79162, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'name,', 'start': 1294402, 'end': 1294566, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'but', 'start': 1294588, 'end': 1294774, 'confidence': 0.99984, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'there', 'start': 1294812, 'end': 1294966, 'confidence': 0.99993, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'was', 'start': 1294988, 'end': 1295126, 'confidence': 0.99997, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'an', 'start': 1295148, 'end': 1295382, 'confidence': 0.5649, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'Xcape', 'start': 1295436, 'end': 1296194, 'confidence': 0.33636, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'meeting', 'start': 1296242, 'end': 1296674, 'confidence': 0.99994, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'here', 'start': 1296722, 'end': 1296886, 'confidence': 0.99992, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'at', 'start': 1296908, 'end': 1297046, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'Sussex', 'start': 1297068, 'end': 1297474, 'confidence': 0.64487, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'and', 'start': 1297522, 'end': 1297638, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'I', 'start': 1297644, 'end': 1297766, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'spoke', 'start': 1297788, 'end': 1297986, '